(5566,	416,	'_elementor_data',	'[{\"id\":\"24faa18\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"40c4e71\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"1dd68e3\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"row\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"98b5eb9\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"11ebfcf\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"\",\"id\":\"\",\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"8960de8\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b1e060e\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"963d643\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"container_type\":\"grid\",\"grid_columns_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":1,\"sizes\":[]},\"grid_justify_items\":\"center\",\"grid_align_items\":\"center\",\"presetTitle\":\"Grid\",\"presetIcon\":\"eicon-container-grid\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"f8e5482\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Rolemir Kirk Don Diango Zayas\",\"title_color\":\"#FFEA00\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"8551a72\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>\\/ roo-leh-meer kerk don dee-ahn-goh zai-yahs \\/<\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"_title\":\"Text Editor\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"93b297c\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"f242b00\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>With over three years of hands-on programming experience, I specialize in building functional, production-ready web applications. I\\u2019ve delivered more than 10 completed projects across technologies like PHP, Laravel, Next.js, React, Java, HTML, and CSS. My work includes real-world systems currently in use, such as a custom application built for an LPG retail center in Cagayan de Oro City.<\\/p>\",\"_title\":\"Text Editor\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"c70ed38\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7358f2f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Complementing my technical expertise, I possess strong communication and client-facing skills. Throughout my academic career, I consistently served as the lead presenter for team projects. Beyond the classroom, I frequently pitch custom systems directly to clients and refine my communication daily as a Customer Service Representative for a U.S.-based company. This unique blend of technical ability and active client management allows me to bridge the gap between complex code and clear business value.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"61f9737\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6c2e7a9\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Outside of tech, I am an avid trail runner and endurance athlete, competing in marathons, ultra-marathons, and backyard ultras. You can usually find me hiking in the mountains or training in the gym. Pushing my limits physically keeps me disciplined and refreshed, providing a healthy, high-energy counterbalance to the time I spend behind the screen.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
