uploads/2026/08/colab_setup-1024x885.jpeg 1024w, http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/colab_setup-768x664.jpeg 768w, http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/colab_setup-1536x1327.jpeg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2048px) 100vw, 2048px\" />													<p>I am a Computer Science student from the University of Mindanao with a strong interest in programming and web development. I enjoy building applications, learning new technologies, and solving problems through code. I continuously improve my skills by working on projects and exploring different tools and technologies in software development. My primary interests lie in <strong data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"644\">software engineering and cybersecurity</strong>, where I aim to build reliable, secure, and well-designed software.</p>			<h1>My Recent Projects</h1>		<p>throughout the year 2026</p>					\n								<figure><img data-src=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-06-16-132037.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-06-16 132037\" /></figure><figure><img data-src=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-24-151234.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-24 151234\" /></figure><figure><img data-src=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-26-011442.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-26 011442\" /></figure><figure><img data-src=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-24-151314.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-24 151314\" /></figure><figure><img data-src=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-26-011428.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-26 011428\" /></figure><figure><img data-src=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-26-020339.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-26 020339\" /></figure>',	'Home',	'',	'inherit',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'37-revision-v1',	'',	'',	'2026-08-26 02:07:08',	'2026-08-25 18:07:08'