uploads/2026/08/colab_setup-1024x885.jpeg 1024w, http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/colab_setup-768x664.jpeg 768w, http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/colab_setup-1536x1327.jpeg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2048px) 100vw, 2048px\" />													<p>I am a Computer Science student from the University of Mindanao with a strong interest in programming and web development. I enjoy building applications, learning new technologies, and solving problems through code. I continuously improve my skills by working on projects and exploring different tools and technologies in software development. My primary interests lie in <strong data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"644\">software engineering and cybersecurity</strong>, where I aim to build reliable, secure, and well-designed software.</p>			<h1>My Recent Projects</h1>		<p>throughout the year 2026</p>					\n								<figure><img data-src=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-06-16-132037.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-06-16 132037\" /></figure><figure><img data-src=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-24-151234.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-24 151234\" /></figure><figure><img data-src=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-26-011442.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-26 011442\" /></figure><figure><img data-src=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-24-151314.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-24 151314\" /></figure><figure><img data-src=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-26-011428.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-26 011428\" /></figure><figure><img data-src=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-27-092526.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-27 092526\" /></figure>			\n							<h1>Certificates</h1>															<img width=\"1024\" height=\"787\" src=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DATABASE-1024x787.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DATABASE-1024x787.png 1024w, http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DATABASE-300x230.png 300w, http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DATABASE-768x590.png 768w, http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DATABASE.png 1367w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />																										<img width=\"1024\" height=\"719\" src=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-26-200206-1024x719.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-26-200206-1024x719.png 1024w, http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-26-200206-300x211.png 300w, http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-26-200206-768x539.png 768w, http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-26-200206.png 1497w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />																										<img width=\"1024\" height=\"789\" src=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/HTMLCSS-1024x789.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/HTMLCSS-1024x789.png 1024w, http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/HTMLCSS-300x231.png 300w, http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/HTMLCSS-768x592.png 768w, http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/HTMLCSS.png 1366w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />',	'Home',	'',	'inherit',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'37-revision-v1',	'',	'',	'2026-08-27 13:44:24',	'2026-08-27 05:44:24',	'',	37,	'http://rzayasportfolio.local/?p=406',	0,	'revision',	'',	0),
