(416,	1,	'2026-08-27 14:30:25',	'2026-08-27 06:30:25',	'<h2>Rolemir Kirk Don Diango Zayas</h2>		<p>/ roo-leh-meer kerk don dee-ahn-goh zai-yahs /</p><p>With over three years of hands-on programming experience, I specialize in building functional, production-ready web applications. I’ve delivered more than 10 completed projects across technologies like PHP, Laravel, Next.js, React, Java, HTML, and CSS. My work includes real-world systems currently in use, such as a custom application built for an LPG retail center in Cagayan de Oro City.</p><p>Complementing my technical expertise, I possess strong communication and client-facing skills. Throughout my academic career, I consistently served as the lead presenter for team projects. Beyond the classroom, I frequently pitch custom systems directly to clients and refine my communication daily as a Customer Service Representative for a U.S.-based company. This unique blend of technical ability and active client management allows me to bridge the gap between complex code and clear business value.</p><p>Outside of tech, I am an avid trail runner and endurance athlete, competing in marathons, ultra-marathons, and backyard ultras. You can usually find me hiking in the mountains or training in the gym. Pushing my limits physically keeps me disciplined and refreshed, providing a healthy, high-energy counterbalance to the time I spend behind the screen.</p>',	'About  Me',	'',	'inherit',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'7-revision-v1',	'',	'',	'2026-08-27 14:30:25',	'2026-08-27 06:30:25',	'',	7,	'http://rzayasportfolio.local/?p=416',	0,	'revision',	'',	0),
