(425,	1,	'2026-08-27 14:59:56',	'2026-08-27 06:59:56',	'<h2>Rolemir Kirk Don Diango Zayas</h2>		<p>/ roo-leh-meer kerk don dee-ahn-goh zai-yahs /</p>													<img width=\"828\" height=\"873\" src=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Image_20260827_144551_805.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Image_20260827_144551_805.png 828w, http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Image_20260827_144551_805-285x300.png 285w, http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Image_20260827_144551_805-768x810.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 828px) 100vw, 828px\" />													<p>With over three years of hands-on programming experience, I specialize in building functional, production-ready web applications. I’ve delivered more than 10 completed projects across technologies like PHP, Laravel, Next.js, React, Java, HTML, and CSS. My work includes real-world systems currently in use, such as a custom application built for an LPG retail center in Cagayan de Oro City.</p><p>Complementing my technical expertise, I possess strong communication and client-facing skills. Throughout my academic career, I consistently served as the lead presenter for team projects. Beyond the classroom, I frequently pitch custom systems directly to clients and refine my communication daily as a Customer Service Representative for a U.S.-based company. This unique blend of technical ability and active client management allows me to bridge the gap between complex code and clear business value.</p>													<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" src=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/meet_UMDC0-scaled.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/meet_UMDC0-scaled.jpeg 2560w, http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/meet_UMDC0-300x169.jpeg 300w, http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/meet_UMDC0-1024x576.jpeg 1024w, http://rzayasportfol